#op: bind
A lineage in the authoring form is bound with its tip, which is the newest
version at the version it cuts as. The tip removes a field without writing a
ForwardLens, so that lens is missing: the lineage binds, with a warning for
each lens the tip's edge lacks.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	name: string
	crew: int
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	name: string
}
-- out/response.json --
{
